tmp_text "fatigue - points are used for the new ability-system. if you do not haveany special abilities in your guild by now, do not worry about them, theywill not influence you.if you are in a guild with special abilities, the fatigue - points willdetermine, how \"tired\" you will get when using a certain special ability.e.g. the usage of karate at the ninjas will cost you a certain amount ofthese fatigue-points. type \"help ability karate\" to see the amount.pat**hi,since we are having memory problems, expect crashes every 6 hours.i am working on getting this fixed./herp***Please goto the mentor board and readthe note i have posted there. thankyouApollo**um... isn't that what spell point's are for???when did this become a diku Mud??  (why would you WANT it to???)ack!**Try man fatigue_points   they are not movement pointsand are not used for movement as a standarddiku mud.  they are used for abilities. Therefor they willact sort of like more SP.-Mangla**As many of you have heard, there is a government bill going throughthat would put a LOT of censorship on internet.  There is a petitionout to let them know we disagree...simply email to:S314-petition@netcom.comand the message should include:SIGNED (your email address) (your name) (u.s. citizen (y/n))example:SIGNED s_cphite@vaxa.clarion.EDU  Craig P. Hite  YESInclude ONLY this in the letter... If you need more info, email meat S_CPHITE@VAXA.CLARION.EDU and I'll send you it.Later!Wilbie**Liberal-Fascist-communist????  shows how uniformed you are...Liberal and communist go together, but fascist??? Mussoline and Hitler wereNO liberals, let me tell you...Second...socialism works...we are just too stupid and blind to see it...Germany and the rest of Europe have adopted it, and sure, it has itsflaws, but it is better than seeing our children starving while we give taxbreaks to the people who have all the money...And even if all this were untrue.