is.  Maybe logingtransfering players would help, if this would be possible.I already know that the healing of players is logged so we can show thatI was not healed by a wiz, and the same with my healing rate...same as normalunlike I was accused of.  This is going to be a long battle tostraighten out the killing of players, But is long worth the work.Thanks for listening.DEMO**  Socialism is the first step to Communism!!!   And communism works in only two places        1) Hell where the already have it,          2)And heaven where they don't need it!    This is a quote from a famous american wonder if anyone knows who it is?      Haplo**Ok, now I keep getting \"talked to\" by wizzes about my player killings.they try to keep me from doing it, or killing certain people.If pk is legal, why is everyone yelling at me for doing itor should i say \"talking to\" me about it, when all they do istry and stop me from killing people, and especially their friendsIt's your choice wizzes, if it's legal for me to kill, ACT LIKE IT.ThanksDEMO**I agree with Demo (and hope I am not on his \"next\" list)One of the stipulations in \"help playerkilling\" is for no wizinvolvement.  Please back up your words with actionsand leave Demo alone.  Thanks.Mango (only killed one player so far, so there)**it is legal to kill players, okit is also legal to talk with you about itso don't complain/Muzmuz**socialism is what differs us from animals/Muzmuz** No, intelligence, reasoning, and concern for our fellow human beings is what seperates us from animals.  Socialism is just a way to put a leash on people and control them (like animals).  Wilbie **No, Wilbie, ego seperates us from animals... Only humansactually believe that they are superior in intellegence, reasoning, etc...**a player does not need to justify him/herself for a pk.i would call bothering a player because of pks is interference too.so, wizzes, please stop this. nobody for